The PDF is the concrete end of the reporting workflow: **select the campaign scope → refresh and compare the data → review the evidence → export the detailed report**. That replaces collecting screenshots from another team. The Account team can send the PDF to the client's specialist without rebuilding that detailed report manually.

The output follows the Clario identity with white 16:9 pages, readable charts and supporting detail, in English or Vietnamese. The image below is a **sample-data report rendered locally**. It demonstrates the format; the internal adoption and estimated preparation time described above come from our working use.
